You jump through different thoughts to distract yourself from the lewd noises coming a few meters away from you. <span class="lewd">A loud moan startles you</span>, and Bailey's snickering makes you flinch.
<br><br>

A pair of keys rattle, followed by a door scraping open. It's slammed shut just as fast.
<br><br>

The silence returns to the hallway, but it takes a few seconds for you to get comfortable enough to look. Once you do, they're already gone. <<gtrauma>><<trauma 6>><<garousal>><<arousal 600>>
